<title>ZAMBIA: SOCCER-ZAMBIA BEAT MOZAMBIQUE 2-1 IN COSAFA CASTLE CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ZAMBIA BEAT MOZAMBIQUE 2-1 IN COSAFA CASTLE CUP.</headline>
<dateline>LUSAKA 1997-08-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a Cosafa Castle Cup</p>
<p>match played at the Independence stadium in Lusaka on Saturday:</p>
<p>Zambia 2 Mozambique 1 (halftime 0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Zambia - Frazier Kamwandi (50th minute, 81st)</p>
<p>Mozambique - Sergio Faife (51st)</p>
<p>    Standings   p  w  d  l  f  a  pts</p>
<p>    Zambia	3  2  1  0  8  3  7</p>
<p>    Namibia     3  1  2  0  5  2  5</p>
<p>Mozambique  4  1  2  1  7  5  5</p>
<p>    Tanzania    3  0  2  1  2  5  2</p>
<p>    Malawi	3  0  1  2  3 10  1</p>
<p>Next match: Malawi v Tanzania, Lilongwe, August 9</p>
